                        "sense_id": "c703b5c6-8f82-37c8-a9fa-5a4930499ded",
                        "entry_id": "7b6a29e7-333e-3693-8672-627afaffb1e5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To treat someone as if they were a hero."
